<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=328" title="View the profile of maxo">maxo</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 20<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=328"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg9765#msg9765"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg9765#msg9765">Re: History of Rodcet Nife  [read and add to it]</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #150 on:</b> August 06, 2004, 02:02:18 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I will always remember the Controllers of the Sky.<br /><br />Seemed like half the server (at least on the qeynos end of the world) was in that guild before it suddenly collapsed.<br /><br />Brews marching into PoP pretty handily now.<br /><br />Mostly marching into RL dancing, sports and stuff myself.&nbsp; Major EQ burnout since last January.<br /><br />I remember the wonder of reaching the South Karana bridge and seeing all super high level folks who actually had TWO names.<br /><br />And you had to have a GM to get your name back then of course.<br /><br />And who knew what the spires were for- except an unusual land mark to pull to.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10041"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=773" title="View the profile of Cocomo">Cocomo</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 14<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/terminator.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Retired Paladin<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=773"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg10041#msg10041"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg10041#msg10041">Re: History of Rodcet Nife  [read and add to it]</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #151 on:</b> August 12, 2004, 11:02:19 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<b>More dirt on Carol-Jeet saga in EK</b><br /><br />From Easter Keep&#039;s public forum (sometime in Nov 2002)<br /><a href="http://www.easternkeep.com/forums/showthread.php?s=&amp;threadid=3581&amp;highlight=jeet" target="_blank">http://www.easternkeep.com/forums/showthread.php?s=&amp;threadid=3581&amp;highlight=jeet<br /></a><br /><br /><b>Jeet wrote</b><br /><br />The Past<br /><br />When I first started playing again a little over a year ago, one of the first raids I did with my guild was a Sev raid to do an epic.<br /><br />We were almost done gathering and getting prepped. Then EK comes into the zone and kills him from under our noses. At that time period, EK was much more established than my guild was, and the only reason it was done was to spite my guild, and probably more directly me (I&#039;m not gona go into the whole history of events before that in this thread). At this point in time there was pretty much no way my guild could compete efficiency-wise with EK, so all we could do was sit and watch. That part I could stomach. What really pissed me off was Carol mocking us in ooc, UNPROVOKED, and sending people in my guild tells of the same nature. This is just 1 example of a few incidents that happened. I think I would have lost all hope in EK except for one thing. Yohon decided not to attend that raid. It reminded me of the kinds of friendships I had in EK.<br /><br />I&#039;m not gona lie. I have grown quite resentful towards EK as a whole and am probably responsible for spreading some of that resent to other people since leaving EK. I&#039;ve gone as far as flat out ignoring any EK I came across with the exception of a few people. Among other things. I praised the lord when my guild moved on and started doing different mobs that EK wasn&#039;t doing.<br /><br />But...time goes on. You get over things. You think about fun stuff you used to do, and who you did it with.<br /><br />This is my apology to any EK I&#039;ve more or less been a full on jackass to. I like to think I&#039;m at least a little justified for doing it, but in the end I don&#039;t like to be that kind of person. At least not for the reason I was doing it.<br /><br />I like to compete, whether it&#039;s on a guild level in EQ or anything else. Competing on a friendly level is fun, and it makes you better at what you&#039;re doing. Competing out of spite has to be one of the ugliest things there can be.<br /><br />Regards,<br /><br />Jeet<br /><br /><br /><b>Carol wrote</b><br /><br />Hello!<br /><br />I have not been playing for sometime and probably start thinking about the things that I have done before which I think is quite silly. Just that I do not really bother about what other people think in the past, and that&#039;s why I do not explain things usually. I am sure I am a short-tempered person, provoked easily and sometimes things just get uglier. For that, I apologize.<br /><br />There are 2 things that I think some people might like to know, one is the Sev incident that Jeet mention and the other one is the POG robe that was given to Ielen instead of Winkin which subsequently led to the disbanding of major numbers of high levels EK.<br /><br />PoG raid, after I came back after a long break which I think I should have let the other officers do the loot then but I didn¡¦t for that mage robe. I honestly thought there is only 1 mage in POG, that¡¦s Ielen and thus call out his name and which he in turns looted so fast ƒº Yes, that matter is my screwed up. It should have gone to Winkin then¡K. Sorry Winkin¡K..<br /><br />Shortly, after I came back I started to invite back the Taiwan members, Winc, Yimmnu(Rebi) and some new member Cutefatfat, Cloobs, etc whom in turns joined Arirang now but Winc and Rebi turns out to be a very good addition which they brought in the Wu family. At that time, the officers aren¡¦t happy about the invites but then I insisted so that we can carry out raid during nighttime Asia. These are some events that trigger some officers to leave the guild and eventually some other members as well.<br /><br />In this game, I bet everyone knows that there is some ¡§unharmony¡¨ between EK and AoD maybe because of the early days when EK farms POF after they cleared the planes and them been nasty about it. I didn¡¦t think that was cheap at that time, I knew then that EK with that strength couldn¡¦t break POF without some equipment and experiences from that zone. And yes after sometime, we manage to break in fear after spending plenty of time doing CR. I think I do not hate anyone from AOD, maybe dislike but not to the extend of hate. I can only think of Axine, she always been so nice in front of me, but then behind my back she is the one that spread the bad things about me, which I think, is very hypocritical.<br /><br />The EJ dragon, Sev popped and at that time, I still remember we finished our raid and heard that AoD failed Sev once. I think they have insufficient people then, so we port over to EJ and remain at the portal. At that time, I saw EIE members in EJ also and then I realize that raid is not AoD¡¦s but it¡¦s for EIE¡¦s warrior. He send me a tell and asked for the green scale for his epic, which I agreed he can have it if we killed him. Then again AoD fail or get train, I am not sure, I asked Vison to pull Sev to the druid spire and we killed it. No green scale. Why do I want to kill Sev?? Maybe just to ¡§get even¡¨ with AoD which I do not really know a reason or just want been an assh0le ƒº<br /><br />I think there are many more incidents and adventures throughout these few years of playing Everquest. Too short time to be reminded of all, but I just want to tell those people from EIE and AOD whom I have offended before and never want to admit. I apologize to you all ƒº<br /><br />See you in the next game.<br /><br /><b>Jeet wrote back</b><br /><br />The mage in question did not disband. He was removed.<br /><br />That decision, along with many others in the past, is what caused myself and then many others to leave EK.<br /><br /><b>Carol wrote back</b><br /><br />I did not guildremove Winkin, I always thought he disbanded himself.<br /><br />-----------------<br />I am just posting the history for the sake of history.&nbsp; I hope I am not stirring anything up here&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smarty.gif" alt="smarty" border="0" /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10169"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=556" title="View the profile of Dalla">Dalla</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 33<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/boobies.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								An Everquest Player on Rodcet Nife<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=556"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg10169#msg10169"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg10169#msg10169">Re: History of Rodcet Nife  [read and add to it]</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #152 on:</b> August 17, 2004, 11:26:40 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							It&#039;s funny the incidents remained ingrained in your brain forever, but somehow the names fall by the wayside.&nbsp; A little part of me misses Winkin.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
