	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11285"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=792" title="View the profile of Colleen">Colleen</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 61<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=792"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg11285#msg11285"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg11285#msg11285">Re: History of Rodcet Nife  [read and add to it]</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #160 on:</b> September 19, 2004, 10:12:37 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I know this is way back but I remember a druid by the name of Mindial and he was in EK. A long time ago he told me he left that guild because of an argument he had with Jeet.&nbsp; I have always wondered what happened. Mindial was always bragging he was the best druid on the server and often he would talk about his former guild EK.&nbsp; Boy did he share what he thought about uber guilds.. I tend to not like to burn bridges so I just sat back and listened.&nbsp; I occationally send a wrong tells to peeps ( mostly its perverted) but once he said that Honch was an A- Hole and I told Mindial that he was just jeolous of Ascent of them and its just a game..&nbsp; DOH and I sent it to Honch instead of Mindial.. But anyway I was defending Honch to say the least.&nbsp; I like just&nbsp; about everyone on the server.. But anyway there is my question.. Jeet what did Mindial do in EK to merit the hatred he has for uber guilds...<br /><br />Jeet what the heck happened ?<br /><br /><br />Colleen Quickness<br />65 Apotheosis&nbsp; &nbsp; 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
